{"name":"Shussel","status":"ok","title":"Shussel","pageId":13083,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Shussel\" title=\"Category:Maps of Shussel\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Shussel</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p42_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unther\" title=\"Unther\">Unther</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/East_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"East Faerûn\">East Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"size\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Small city</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Politics<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rulertype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruler's type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Lord</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">History<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p42_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p42-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OE-p43_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OE-p43-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG186_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG186-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"end event\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">1385</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Destroyed during the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9,150 in <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a><br/>25,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a><br/>70,000 in <a href=\"/wiki/1057_DR\" title=\"1057 DR\">1057 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler1\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Lord</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ekur\" title=\"Ekur\">Ekur</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Inhabitants_of_Shussel\" title=\"Category:Inhabitants of Shussel\">Inhabitants of  Shussel</a></nav>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Locations_in_Shussel\" title=\"Category:Locations in Shussel\">Locations in  Shussel</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Shussel</b> was a small city on the northern shore of the <a href=\"/wiki/Alamber_Sea\" title=\"Alamber Sea\">Alamber Sea</a>, in <a href=\"/wiki/Unther\" title=\"Unther\">Unther</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OEp42_5-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OEp42-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Government\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Government</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Economy\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Economy</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Religion\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Religion</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shussel?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Shussel served was fishing town, however it used to be a mining outpost at some point of its history. It had its own supply of <a href=\"/wiki/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">iron</a> from nearby mines, but by <a href=\"/wiki/1357_DR\" title=\"1357 DR\">1357 DR</a> the supply was dwindling. The fields to the north of the city had been overfarmed and turned to sandy, poor conditions as a result.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OEp42_5-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OEp42-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Its port was heavily fortified to defend the city against the <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin\" title=\"Sahuagin\">sahuagin</a> from nearby waters.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OEp43_6-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OEp43-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Government\">Government</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Government\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shussel?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Government\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of 1357 DR, Shussel was ruled by Lord <a href=\"/wiki/Ekur\" title=\"Ekur\">Ekur</a>, who had under his command a large force of <a href=\"/wiki/Chessenta\" title=\"Chessenta\">Chessentan</a> mercenaries.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OEp43_6-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OEp43-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Economy\">Economy</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Economy\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shussel?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Economy\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of 1357 DR, Shussel was poor community whose resources had been overused. Its port was small and not much frequented.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OEp43_6-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OEp43-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Religion\">Religion</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Religion\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shussel?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Religion\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The priesthood of <a href=\"/wiki/Ishtar\" title=\"Ishtar\">Ishtar</a> had a great influence in Shussel, and it was thanks to their efforts that the people didn't have a famine crisis.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-OEp43_6-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-OEp43-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shussel?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <a href=\"/wiki/1370_DR\" title=\"1370 DR\">1370 DR</a>, in an event called \"the Vanishing\", a mysterious fog descended upon the city and overnight, ninety percent of the city's inhabitants vanished. The sudden underpopulation and abundance of homes brought squatters and bandits. The city was later conquered by the <a href=\"/wiki/Mulhorand\" title=\"Mulhorand\">Mulhorandi</a>, that used its port to bring in supplies for their war effort against Unther.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p187_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p187-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>In <a href=\"/wiki/1374_DR\" title=\"1374 DR\">1374 DR</a>, the vanished people returned much like they had vanished, but transformed into <a href=\"/wiki/Aasimar\" title=\"Aasimar\">aasimar</a> and as part of a military group known as the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvTGVnaW9uX29mX05hbm5hLVNpbj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Legion of Nanna-Sin (page does not exist)\">Legion of Nanna-Sin</span>, that opposed the Mulhorandi.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-PoF-p28_7-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-PoF-p28-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Shussel was destroyed alongside the rest of Unther during the <a href=\"/wiki/Spellplague\" title=\"Spellplague\">Spellplague</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/1385_DR\" title=\"1385 DR\">1385 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCG186_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCG186-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shussel?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Shussel?veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-OE-p42-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p42_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p42_1-1\">1.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scott_Bennie\" title=\"Scott Bennie\">Scott Bennie</a> (February 1990). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Old_Empires_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Old Empires (sourcebook)\">Old Empires</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Mike_Breault\" title=\"Mike Breault\">Mike Breault</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/TSR,_Inc.\" title=\"TSR, Inc.\">TSR, Inc.</a>), p. 42. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0880388214\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0880388214\">978-0880388214</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-OE-p43-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-OE-p43_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <su